---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/navigation/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/navigation/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Security Statement | Shris AI"
  description="Enterprise security architecture for Shris AI: encryption, isolation, ZDR, RBAC, and India-region sovereignty."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-main">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow-text">Platform</p>
      <h1>Security Statement</h1>
      <p class="lead">Designed for banks, hospitals, and regulated enterprises that require strict data boundary controls.</p>

      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <div class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-indigo">Transit</span>
          <h2>TLS 1.3 & SRTP</h2>
          <p>SIP signalling and media are encrypted. API traffic is TLS 1.3 only.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-indigo">At rest</span>
          <h2>AES-256</h2>
          <p>Databases use AES-256 with optional customer-managed keys on dedicated VPC.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-emerald">Isolation</span>
          <h2>Tenant VPC</h2>
          <p>Enterprise can deploy inside isolated AWS, Azure, or GCP VPCs in India.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-emerald">Governance</span>
          <h2>RBAC & audit</h2>
          <p>Immutable logs for every agent edit and tool invocation. See <a href="/docs/dpdp-security">DPDP docs</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-main { padding-top: 6.5rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .legal-main h1 { color: var(--shris-navy-950); margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem; }
  .legal-main h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0.85rem 0 0.45rem; }
  .legal-main p { color: var(--shris-tx-secondary); line-height: 1.65; }
  .legal-main a { color: var(--shris-indigo); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
